ob filename text tweet be input ya

exists su name mind model ob text "qwen3.5:9b" be default ya
su name mind configure be map def
  su name think ob bool lie ya
  su name max tokens ob num 64 ya
prah
exists su name chirp mind be mind as name "qwen3.5:9b" fromtext text "You write concise, high-engagement social replies." ya
exists su name chirp clamp mind be mind as name "qwen3.5:9b" fromtext text "You rewrite one short question under hard constraints. Output only one plain-text question line." ya

exists su name chirp hook prompt ob text quoted.text.Write a super short, bold first-line Hook (max 8 words) for a reply to this tweet.

Rules:
- Strong agreement, sharp contrarian twist, or direct question.
- Plain text only.
- Output ONLY the hook line..text.quoted be text ya

exists su name chirp value prompt ob text quoted.text.Add one punchy Value line (1-2 short sentences) for this hook + tweet context.

Rules:
- Deliver one fresh insight, data point, personal example, or missing angle.
- Focus on a different aspect than the prior segment.
- Do not repeat prior segment wording or same core claim.
- Specific and useful, no fluff.
- Keep the value between 60 and 110 characters.
- Plain text only.
- Output ONLY the value line(s)..text.quoted be text ya

exists su name chirp question prompt ob text quoted.text.End with one specific engagement Question for this full draft context.

Rules:
- Open-ended but targeted.
- Ask from a different angle than the prior segment.
- Do not restate prior segment wording or same core claim.
- Plain text only.
- Output ONLY the question line..text.quoted be text ya

exists su name chirp question clamp prompt ob text quoted.text.Rewrite the user question draft so it satisfies all rules exactly.

Hard rules:
- One line only, plain text only.
- 5 to 16 words.
- 25 to 80 characters total.
- Must end with question mark.
- Keep the same meaning as the draft.
- If you cannot satisfy all rules, output exactly: What housing policy helps families most?
- Output ONLY the rewritten question line..text.quoted be text ya

su name chirp hook retry fromindex num 0 toindex num 0 be ceremony def
  ob name text chirp hook pass be equally from text true then be depart do
  su name chirp hook write retry stage ob name text hookreq fromtext name chirp hook prompt for name chirp mind to name text output by num 0 be write do
  su name chirp hook words verify stage be verify as wo word count atleast num 4 atmost num 8 from name text output to name map chirp hook words verify do
  su name chirp hook letters verify stage be verify as wo letter count atleast num 15 atmost num 45 from name text output to name map chirp hook letters verify do
  ob text of pass of chirp hook words verify to name text chirp hook words pass be text do
  ob text of pass of chirp hook letters verify to name text chirp hook letters pass be text do
  ob text "true" to name text chirp hook pass be text do
  ob name text chirp hook words pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "false" to name text chirp hook pass be text do
  ob name text chirp hook letters pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "false" to name text chirp hook pass be text do
  ob name text chirp hook pass be equally from text true then be depart do
prah

su name chirp hook checked to name text output be ceremony def
  su name chirp hook write stage ob name text hookreq fromtext name chirp hook prompt for name chirp mind to name text output by num 0 be write do
  su name chirp hook words verify stage be verify as wo word count atleast num 4 atmost num 8 from name text output to name map chirp hook words verify do
  su name chirp hook letters verify stage be verify as wo letter count atleast num 15 atmost num 45 from name text output to name map chirp hook letters verify do
  ob text of pass of chirp hook words verify to name text chirp hook words pass be text do
  ob text of pass of chirp hook letters verify to name text chirp hook letters pass be text do
  ob text "true" to name text chirp hook pass be text do
  ob name text chirp hook words pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "false" to name text chirp hook pass be text do
  ob name text chirp hook letters pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "false" to name text chirp hook pass be text do
  fromindex num 1 toindex num 3 be chirp hook retry do
  ob name text chirp hook pass be equally from text false then
  su name chirp hook words guarantee stage ob bool lie fromtext text "chirp hook constraints defective" be guarantee do
  su name chirp hook return stage ob name text output be text do
prah

