su name chirp value checked from text prior to name text output be ceremony def
  su name chirp value write stage ob name text valuereq fromtext name chirp value prompt for name chirp mind to name text output by num 0 be write do
  su name chirp value words verify stage be verify as wo word count atleast num 12 atmost num 35 from name text output to name map chirp value words verify do
  su name chirp value letters verify stage be verify as wo letter count atleast num 60 atmost num 110 from name text output to name map chirp value letters verify do
