su name chirp question retry fromindex num 0 toindex num 0 be ceremony def
  ob name text chirp question pass be equally from text true then be depart do
  su name chirp question write retry stage ob name text questionreq fromtext name chirp question prompt for name chirp mind to name text output by num 0 atmost num 24 be write do
  su name chirp question clamp retry stage ob name text output fromtext name chirp question clamp prompt for name chirp clamp mind to name text output by num 0 atmost num 18 be write do
  ob text "false" to name text chirp question punctuation pass be text do
  ob name text output from text "/\\?\\s*$/" be resemble then
  ob text "true" to name text chirp question punctuation pass be text do
  ob name text chirp question punctuation pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "?" to name output be plus do
  su name chirp question words verify stage be verify as wo word count atleast num 5 atmost num 16 from name text output to name map chirp question words verify do
  su name chirp question letters verify stage be verify as wo letter count atleast num 25 atmost num 80 from name text output to name map chirp question letters verify do
  ob text of pass of chirp question words verify to name text chirp question words pass be text do
  ob text of pass of chirp question letters verify to name text chirp question letters pass be text do
  ob text "true" to name text chirp question pass be text do
  ob name text chirp question words pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "false" to name text chirp question pass be text do
  ob name text chirp question letters pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "false" to name text chirp question pass be text do
  ob name text chirp question pass be equally from text true then be depart do
prah

su name chirp question checked from text prior to name text output be ceremony def
  su name chirp question write stage ob name text questionreq fromtext name chirp question prompt for name chirp mind to name text output by num 0 atmost num 24 be write do
  su name chirp question clamp stage ob name text output fromtext name chirp question clamp prompt for name chirp clamp mind to name text output by num 0 atmost num 18 be write do
  ob text "false" to name text chirp question punctuation pass be text do
  ob name text output from text "/\\?\\s*$/" be resemble then
  ob text "true" to name text chirp question punctuation pass be text do
  ob name text chirp question punctuation pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "?" to name output be plus do
  su name chirp question words verify stage be verify as wo word count atleast num 5 atmost num 16 from name text output to name map chirp question words verify do
  su name chirp question letters verify stage be verify as wo letter count atleast num 25 atmost num 80 from name text output to name map chirp question letters verify do
  ob text of pass of chirp question words verify to name text chirp question words pass be text do
  ob text of pass of chirp question letters verify to name text chirp question letters pass be text do
  ob text "true" to name text chirp question pass be text do
  ob name text chirp question words pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "false" to name text chirp question pass be text do
  ob name text chirp question letters pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "false" to name text chirp question pass be text do
  fromindex num 1 toindex num 3 be chirp question retry do
  ob name text chirp question pass be equally from text false then
  su name chirp question words guarantee stage ob bool lie fromtext text "chirp question constraints defective" be guarantee do
  su name chirp question return stage ob name text output be text do
prah

su name chirp total checked to name text output be ceremony def
  su name chirp total words verify stage be verify as wo word count atleast num 21 atmost num 55 from name text totalreq to name map chirptotalwordsreport do
  su name chirp total letters verify stage be verify as wo letter count atleast num 100 atmost num 320 from name text totalreq to name map chirptotallettersreport do
  ob text of pass of chirptotalwordsreport to name text chirp total words pass be text do
  ob text of pass of chirptotallettersreport to name text chirp total letters pass be text do
  ob name text chirp total words pass be equally from text false then
  su name chirp total words guarantee stage ob bool lie fromtext text "chirp total word count defective" be guarantee do
  ob name text chirp total letters pass be equally from text false then
  su name chirp total letters guarantee stage ob bool lie fromtext text "chirp total letter count defective" be guarantee do
  su name chirp total return stage ob name text totalreq be text do
prah

su name chirp reply run be refinery def
  su name chirp source stage from filename of ob of tweet become wo text to name text chirpsource be read do

  su name chirp hook request stage ob name text chirpsource to name text hookreq be text do
  su name chirp hook stage to name text hookout be chirp hook checked do

  su name chirp value request begin stage ob text "HOOK:\n" to name text valuereq be text do
  su name chirp value request hook stage ob name text hookout to name valuereq be plus do
  su name chirp value request source header stage ob text "\n\nORIGINAL TWEET:\n" to name valuereq be plus do
  su name chirp value request source stage ob name text chirpsource to name valuereq be plus do
  su name chirp value stage from text of ob of hookout to name text valueout be chirp value checked do

  su name chirp question request begin stage ob text "HOOK:\n" to name text questionreq be text do
  su name chirp question request hook stage ob name text hookout to name questionreq be plus do
  su name chirp question request value header stage ob text "\n\nVALUE:\n" to name questionreq be plus do
  su name chirp question request value stage ob name text valueout to name questionreq be plus do
  su name chirp question request source header stage ob text "\n\nORIGINAL TWEET:\n" to name questionreq be plus do
  su name chirp question request source stage ob name text chirpsource to name questionreq be plus do
  su name chirp question stage from text of ob of valueout to name text questionout be chirp question checked do

  su name chirp out begin stage ob name text hookout to name text chirpout be text do
  su name chirp out join one stage ob text "\n" to name chirpout be plus do
  su name chirp out value stage ob name text valueout to name chirpout be plus do
  su name chirp out join two stage ob text "\n" to name chirpout be plus do
  su name chirp out question stage ob name text questionout to name chirpout be plus do

  su name chirp total request stage ob name text chirpout to name text totalreq be text do
  su name chirp total stage to name text chirpout be chirp total checked do

  su name chirp out stage ob name text chirpout be write do
  su name chirp return stage ob name text chirpout be text do
prah

from name chirp reply run be refinery do
